es\n\n```cpp\n\nvoid ckernel::mm_init(uint32_t in0_cb_id = 0,"},{"r":25773,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":19,"l":"","x":"## Kernel Synchronization\n\nCircular Buffer (CB)\n\n- SRAM memory object with hardware enabled flow control\n\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\"><thead><tr><th>Argument</th><th>Description</th><th>Type</"},{"r":25774,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":20,"l":"","x":"- Kernels for asynchronous pre-load / spill to DRAM"},{"r":25775,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":21,"l":"","x":"## All RISC-V Programmable Within the Ethernet Core\n\noff-chip\n\nEthernet"},{"r":25776,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":22,"l":"","x":"## Scale-out"},{"r":25777,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":23,"l":"","x":"## Blackhole: Ethernet-Based Scale out\n\n1 TB/s of Blackhole Ethernet\n\nCan be connected into any topology\n\nMesh topology is great for AI\n\nLocality and regularity of data movement\n\nSharded data\n\n200 GB/"},{"r":25778,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":24,"l":"","x":"## Blackhole Galaxy: 32 chips in a 4x8 Mesh\n\n## 11.2 TB/s Galaxy I/O\n\nX dim I/O: 8 x 200 GB/s\n\nY dim I/O: 16 x 200 GB/s\n\nZ dim I/O: 32 x 200 GB/s"},{"r":25779,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":25,"l":"","x":"## Blackhole Galaxy: Scale-out \"Lego\" building block\n\n24 PFLOPs \"AI compute\"\n\n16 TB/s BW, 1 TB capacity \"AI memory\"\n\n11. 2 TB/s I/O \"AI switch\""},{"r":25780,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":26,"l":"","x":"## Software"},{"r":25781,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":27,"l":"","x":"## TT-Metalium: Built for Al and Scale-out\n\n- Kernels are plain C++ with APIs\n\nDedicated data movement & compute kernels\n\n- Optimize data movement and compute overlap directly\n\nAny core can read/write"},{"r":25782,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":28,"l":"","x":"## Tenstorrent Open Source Software\n\n- TT-Forge - Integrated into various frameworks for native model ingest\n\n- TT-MLIR - new MLIR-based compiler\n\n- TT-NN - a library of optimized operators\n\nATen cove"},{"r":25783,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":29,"l":"","x":"## Software Ecosystem & Integrations\n\nhttps://github.com/tenstorrent\n\nhttps://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal\n\nhttps://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-mlir"},{"r":25784,"d":375,"s":"pdf","t":"88_HC2024.Tenstorrent.Jasmina.Davor.v7","c":0,"p":30,"l":"","x":"## Thank you"},{"r":25785,"d":61,"s":"pdf","t":"Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig","c":0,"p":1,"l":"Cover","x":"A Modern Approach\n\nThird Edition"},{"r":25786,"d":61,"s":"pdf","t":"Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig","c":0,"p":2,"l":"i","x":"Artificial Intelligence\n\nA Modern Approach\n\nThird Edition"},{"r":25787,"d":61,"s":"pdf","t":"Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig","c":0,"p":3,"l":"ii","x":"FORSYTH & PONCE\n\nGRAHAM\n\nComputer Vision: A Modern Approach\n\nJURAFSKY & MARTIN\n\nNEAPOLITAN\n\nANSI Common Lisp\n\nRUSSELL & NORVIG\n\nSpeech and Language Processing, 2nd ed.\n\nLearning Bayesian Networks\n\nArt"},{"r":25788,"d":61,"s":"pdf","t":"Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig","c":0,"p":4,"l":"iii","x":"## Artificial Intelligence\n\nA Modern Approach\n\nThird Edition\n\n# Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig\n\nContributing writers:\n\nErnest Davis\n\nDouglas D. Edwards\n\nDavid Forsyth\n\nNicholas J. Hay\n\nJitendra M."},{"r":25789,"d":61,"s":"pdf","t":"Stuart J. Russell and Peter Norvig","c":0,"p":5,"l":"iv","x":"Vice President and Editorial Director, ECS: Marcia J. Horton\n\nEditor-in-Chief: Michael Hirsch\n\nExecutive Editor: Tracy Dunkelberger\n\nAssistant Editor: Melinda Haggerty\n\nEditorial Assistant: Allison Mi"},{"r":25790,"d":61,